rted='Keep M as a provisional improvement in this family; compare to DIN before selecting. Plan constant-gain attribution and paired repetitions if consequential.',decision_if_not_supported='Retain DIN; reject this implementation, preserving normalized controls. Consider a subsequent discriminating full-value bypass or representation control rather than concluding all intensity mechanisms fail.'),\n dict(parent_ref='g1-r0000-exchange_q0_w1',intervention='M x Q factorial: (M1Q1-M0Q1)-(M1Q0-M0Q0)',control='mass_m1_q0 and mass_m0_q0 use first_query for the second read; both still pass first-read fields to mixer and writer',held_fixed=fixed,remaining_confounds=['Both reads receive the M intervention; which round matters is not isolated','Q0 retains indirect feedback, so this tests the additional query path only','AUC is nonlinear; interaction is a descriptive metric contrast and requires repetitions'],decision_if_supported='Provisionally retain the refreshed-query configuration and test repetition plus round-specific or constant-gain replacements before claiming feedback-specific support.',decision_if_not_supported='Do not claim cooperative query/intensity mechanism; retain any simpler main effect only if it improves validation quality or measured cost. Avoid interpreting one negative interaction as universal refutation.'),\n dict(parent_ref='baseline-din',intervention='Best validation cell in the new four-cell suite',control='baseline-din; contextual comparison to all four unsuccessful g1-r0000-exchange cells',held_fixed=['Frozen full data/protocol and selection score'],remaining_confounds=['Architecture and dense capacity differ from DIN','Historical exchange cells lack count scalar; no new exact DIN repetition in this batch'],decision_if_supported='Record provisional performance separately from mechanism support; schedule nearest-control repetitions if resources remain.',decision_if_not_supported='Keep baseline-din as incumbent and faithfully retain all unsuccessful 